record jpegxl-rs.evidence.phase0-12mp-thread-scaling-2026-08-13/1 : evidence {
    title "On a 4000x3000 synthetic RGB frame, Modular measured 3729.8 ms serial versus 2074.1 ms auto (1.80x), while fixed VarDCT measured 2965.4 versus 2945.1 ms (1.01x). Fixed VarDCT reported 95,906,268 choose calls, 266,892,288 candidate-forward bytes, and 384,000,000 CfL sample bytes."
    state verified
